\"2. 精确钻孔，保证孔径和位置精度。\", \"3. 检查孔径和位置精度。\", \"[工序4：钻孔加工（小直径通孔）]：\", \"* **刀具：** 镗刀 (D5.0mm, D5.59mm)\", \"* **参数：** 转速1200rpm，进给80mm/min，切深0.2mm/转。\", \"* **操作步骤：**\", \"1. 设定刀具零点。\", \"2. 精确钻孔，保证孔径和位置精度。\", \"3. 检查孔径和位置精度。\", \"[工序5：铰孔加工（小直径盲孔）]：\", \"* **刀具：** 铰孔刀 (D5.0mm, D5.59mm)\", \"* **参数：** 转速600rpm，进给40mm/min，切深0.1mm/转。\", \"* **操作步骤：**\", \"1. 设定刀具零点。\", \"2. 精确铰孔，保证孔径和位置精度。\", \"3. 检查孔径和位置精度。\", \"**注意事项：**\", \"* 以上参数仅供参考，实际加工参数需根据设备、材料、刀具情况进行调整。\", \"* 加工过程中注意冷却液的使用，保证刀具和工件的冷却。\", \"* 定期检查刀具磨损情况，及时更换刀具。\", \"* 加工完毕后，对零件进行全面检查，确认尺寸精度和表面质量。\", \"* 优先保证孔位精度，再考虑表面光洁度。\", \"* 建议采用CAM软件进行路径规划，优化加工效率。\"], \"milling_roughing_time_hours\": 0.28, \"milling_finishing_time_hours\": 0.11, \"milling_semi_finishing_remark\": null, \"turning_equipment_costs_hours\": 0, \"milling_semi_finishing_time_hours\": 0, \"milling_roughing_equipment_costs_hours\": 25, \"milling_finishing_equipment_costs_hours\": 25, \"milling_semi_finishing_equipment_costs_hours\": 0}}',2,'2025-06-18 19:41:02'),(3168,33,2,'quality','D:\\1\\tsh (1)\\output\\nL21i6DHad\\454df1cfcb9c6a2deaa20211eb01dd7e.stp','ra_08','it6','Malaysia','Aluminium 6061-T6',7.00,2.70,'AMAT 0250-20000 App A',0.05,'Conditioning treatment',0.42,1,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-18 19:41:41'),(3169,33,2,'quality','D:\\1\\tsh (1)\\output\\nL21i6DHad\\454df1cfcb9c6a2deaa20211eb01dd7e.stp','ra_08','it6','Malaysia','Aluminium 6061-T6',7.00,2.70,'AMAT 0250-20000 App A',0.05,'Conditioning treatment',0.42,1,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-18 19:41:43'),(3170,33,2,'quality','D:\\1\\tsh (1)\\output\\nL21i6DHad\\454df1cfcb9c6a2deaa20211eb01dd7e.stp','ra_08','it6','Malaysia','Aluminium 6061-T6',7.00,2.70,'AMAT 0250-20000 App A',0.05,'Conditioning treatment',0.42,1,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-18 19:41:45'),(3171,33,2,'quality','D:\\1\\tsh (1)\\output\\nL21i6DHad\\454df1cfcb9c6a2deaa20211eb01dd7e.stp','ra_08','it6','Malaysia','Aluminium 6061-T6',7.00,2.70,'AMAT 0250-20000 App A',0.05,'Conditioning treatment',0.42,1,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-18 19:41:47'),(3172,33,2,'quali